*** Add File:ops/docs/LEVEL4_RUNBOOK.md
+Level 4 Runbook — Achieve High Autonomy (Operational Steps)
+
+Goal: Execute production proofs, validate instrumentation & policies, remediate, and produce signed evidence so Aegis can operate with human intervention only for legal/regulatory exceptions.
+
+Prereqs:
+- Tekton pipelines installed and running in `cicd` namespace.
+- AWS creds configured in cluster service account or operator environment.
+- Cosign key present at /secrets/cosign.key (or KMS-backed signer).
+- Ray cluster / worker nodes with drivers installed for target accelerators.
+
+Steps:
+1) Start master validation
+   - Edit: ops/tekton/pipelineruns/level4_master_pipelinerun.yaml -> set evidence_bucket to your S3 bucket.
+   - Apply: kubectl apply -f ops/tekton/pipelineruns/level4_master_pipelinerun.yaml
+2) Monitor Tekton run; wait for pipeline completion.
+3) After completion, run acceptance checks (if not auto-run):
+   - python3 ops/validation/acceptance_checker.py --evidence s3://your-bucket --out /tmp/acceptance.json
+4) If acceptance failed:
+   - python3 ops/validation/postmortem_generator.py --acceptance /tmp/acceptance.json
+   - Triage action items, create tickets, re-run incremental tests, then re-run master pipeline.
+5) If acceptance passed:
+   - Run ops/scripts/cosign_sign_evidence_bundle.sh to ensure final bundle is signed.
+   - Approve and run GitHub workflow `Level4 Full Validation & Controlled Promote` to optionally promote Gatekeeper constraints (requires manual approval).
+6) Post-validation:
+   - Keep long_term_monitor deployed and collect at least 4 weeks of SLO data (ops/monitoring/long_term_monitor.yaml)
+   - Provide audit package to Legal: ops/ops/prepare_compliance_package.sh produces an S3 manifest and cosign-signed report.
+
+Acceptance Criteria (what the run verifies):
+- Checkpoint success ≥ 0.90 across HPO runs.
+- OTEL coverage ≥ 0.90 for critical spans.
+- OPA harness mismatch rate < 1%.
+- Remediation success rate ≥ 0.90.
+- No remaining critical pen-test findings.
+- Gatekeeper constraints promoted and webhooks validated.
+- Evidence bundles cosign-signed and audit_collector reports present in S3.
+
+If you need help running any step, I can produce the exact kubectl/gh commands, or a pre-filled PipelineRun with your bucket and parameters.
+
